pairs, not just pairs inside transported six-ray bases. Each value
follows by substitution in (65.7), in the exact field
\(\mathbb Q(\sqrt3,\sqrt7,i)\), using
\((\sqrt3)^2=3\), \((\sqrt7)^2=7\), and \(i^2=-1\).
